id=seedvault_backup
name=Seedvault Backup (replaces Google Backup)
version=16-5.8
versionCode=16058
author=magisk-module-seedvault
description=Installs the Seedvault encrypted backup app as a privileged system app and makes it the active Android backup transport in place of Google Backup. Removing the module restores the previous (Google) backup transport. Requires Android 16 and a reboot after install.
